?op=userinfo&uname=Homer"><b>Homer</b></a><br>08/06/2002 9:46:30 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>08/06/2002 9:45:44 am</center><br><center><a href="user.php?op=userinfo&uname=Ziggi"><b>Ziggi</b></a><br>08/06/2002 9:44:08 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>08/06/2002 9:39:04 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>08/06/2002 9:29:19 am</center><br></font></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><img src="images/pix.gif" border="0" width="150" height="1"></td><td>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td width="100%" valign="top"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=5&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Kind of a quiet weekend</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Monday, August 05, 2002 - 08:25 AM EST (0 Reads)<br><br>It was a quiet weekend, but a pretty nice raid in Temple of Veeshan turned up some nice items.   Grats to those who got booty.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments?  <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=5"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=4&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Woushi is our bish</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Thursday, August 01, 2002 - 08:00 AM EST (8 Reads)<br><br>Thats right, Woushi again.  I think we've just about worn that whore out.   But not until we get a few more of those nice druid sheild.<br /><br />
<br /><br />
Grats to those who got stuff.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments?  <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=4"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=3&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Busy Weekend</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Tuesday, July 30, 2002 - 05:58 PM EST (4 Reads)<br><br>Well lets see - Killed Woushi (No MB):<br /><br />
<br /><br />
<img src=http://www.sosguild.com/images/news/woushi1.jpg><br /><br />
<br /><br />
3 Druid Shields, 2 Bows, Blade of Luclin and a few shit spells were teh booty.<br /><br />
<br /><br />
Had this to say out first kill of this pain in the ass:<br /><br />
<br /><br />
<img src=http://www.sosguild.com/images/news/woushi3.jpg><br /><br />
<br /><br />
Ran into PoG to get cash items to replenish the guild fund and managed to get a few drops and an enchanter Robe for Zaray.<br /><br />
<br /><br />
Then we called it a night knowing a patch was coming up tommorow and hoped for another shot at Woushi.<br /><br />
<br /><br />
Well got up that morning and ran into PoG to get more cash items while Pravis Mortis took care of Woushi - Grats them.   Lots of stuff dropped in PoG including Necro Robe and Beastlord Tunic (Grats Tedd and Thomasina).   <br /><br />
<br /><br />
Then we took an hour break to eat.   Came back to servers going down.   Got everyone out to the WL ring and when the servers came back up:<br /><br />
<br /><br />
<img src=http://www.sosguild.com/images/news/woushi2.jpg><br /><br />
<br /><br />
Thats right, Woushi again.  Yeah we used 1 with MB this time.  We managed to get 3 scales for those nice BPs.  Grats Grymm, Thronain and Robynn on 20wis BPs.    Also a bow and a weapon for a druid (/eyeroll)  After this we sent out search parties looking for rares and were disappointed so everyone just factioned or exped.<br /><br />
<br /><br />
All in all it was alot of fun.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments?  <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=3"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br></td><td>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td valign="top" bgcolor="#000000"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="150" bgcolor="8c1818"><tr><td><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><font class="topictitle">Upcomming Events</font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="222222"><font class="content"><font class="content">
